  "instrument": "TMA1995",
  "kind": "section",
  "number": "222",
  "ref": "TMA1995/s222",
  "text": "If a person who neither resides nor carries on business in Australia: (a) gives notice of opposition under section 52 or subsection 65A(4), 83A(4) or 224(6); or (b) applies to the Registrar under Part 9 for a trade mark to be removed from the Register; the Registrar may require the person to give security for the costs of the proceeding and may, if security is not given, dismiss the proceeding.",
